- **Dean**: Haidee Galdo (formerly Riza Siega)
- **Location**: Main Campus, 1st Floor, right side near the entrance, beside the staircase.
- **Accreditation & Affiliations**: PAASCU Accredited, CEAP Member, CHED Recognized.
- **Degrees Offered**:
